            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Side A 0.5.31

- Fewer surprise sign-ins: if a session overwrites a login right after Autopilot moves it, Side A puts it back.
- When an account's login was replaced, the menu says by whose, and autopilot.log records why.
- Usage bars read 5h, Fable, week; a used-up week shows alone.

macOS 14 or later. Apple Silicon and Intel. Free.
